  "name": "Your Two-Voice News Desk - 6 Sources to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - EVERY MORNING, PULL THE SIX SOURCES\n\nOne trigger for the whole pipeline. The six urls live in one node, so swapping a source is a one line edit, not a rebuild.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3f34b51d-94e4-5843-97ae-4387308a55fe",
      "name": "Section - 1 - EVERY MORNING, PULL THE SIX SOURCES",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - KEEP ONLY WHAT IS NEW AND ON TOPIC\n\nKeyword screen first, then a lookup against what the sheet already holds. The same story never gets written or paid for twice.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ee117417-77e5-53f6-a618-516701c11389",
      "name": "Section - 2 - KEEP ONLY WHAT IS NEW AND ON TOPIC",
