        1280,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - REWRITE EVERY STORY IN BOTH VOICES\n\nTwo separate nodes, two separate prompts. Style A reads like a newsroom wire, style B like a signed column, and you can tune one without touching the other.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "f3d16b05-fc2f-541b-a37e-a76176f79b25",
      "name": "Section - 3 - REWRITE EVERY STORY IN BOTH VOICES",
